From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Herrie <Github.com@herrie.org>
Date: Sat, 8 Aug 2026 18:31:54 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] sysbus: drop client permissions for ACGs that do not exist

The legacy files/sysbus client-permissions ask for a number of access
control groups that nothing declares: 'private', 'media',
'applications.internal', 'settings', 'notifications' and
'physicaldevice.devutility'. They grant nothing at runtime but make
do_validate_ls2_acg complain once the service is installed.

Upstream already dropped the first five in the files/sysbus_new
variant; do the same for the legacy files, which is what gets installed
unless USE_NEW_ACG is set. LuneOS cannot switch to sysbus_new yet
because its groups.json uses the newer object form that the shipped
groups.schema and ls-hubd do not accept.

physicaldevice.devutility goes as well: com.webos.service.pdm declares
physicaldevice.query and physicaldevice.management only.

The groups that are kept - physicaldevice.query, activity.query,
camerahal.query, camerahal.operation, camerasolution.query,
camerasolution.operation and camerapipeline.operation - all match the
outbound lists in com.webos.service.camera2.role.json.in and
com.webos.camerahal.role.json.in.
Signed-off-by: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
---
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 files/sysbus/com.webos.service.camera2.perm.json.in       | 8 +-------
 .../hal/files/sysbus/com.webos.camerahal.perm.json        | 1 -
 2 files changed, 1 insertion(+), 8 deletions(-)

diff --git a/files/sysbus/com.webos.service.camera2.perm.json.in b/files/sysbus/com.webos.service.camera2.perm.json.in
index 7da1c4f..c29e017 100644
--- a/files/sysbus/com.webos.service.camera2.perm.json.in
+++ b/files/sysbus/com.webos.service.camera2.perm.json.in
@@ -1,15 +1,9 @@
 {
     "com.webos.service.camera2": [
-        "physicaldevice.query",
-        "private",
-        "media"
+        "physicaldevice.query"
     ],
     "com.webos.service.camera2.*": [
-        "applications.internal",
-        "settings",
-        "notifications",
         "activity.query",
-        "physicaldevice.devutility",
         "camerahal.query",
         "camerahal.operation"
     ],
diff --git a/src/services/hal/files/sysbus/com.webos.camerahal.perm.json b/src/services/hal/files/sysbus/com.webos.camerahal.perm.json
index c43bdff..9a9399b 100644
--- a/src/services/hal/files/sysbus/com.webos.camerahal.perm.json
+++ b/src/services/hal/files/sysbus/com.webos.camerahal.perm.json
@@ -1,6 +1,5 @@
 {
     "com.webos.camerahal.*":[
-        "private",
         "camerasolution.query",
         "camerasolution.operation"
     ]
